    {
      "filename": "大手門の向こう Beyond the Gate (8359544249).jpg",
      "title": "File:大手門の向こう Beyond the Gate (8359544249).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/%E5%A4%A7%E6%89%8B%E9%96%80%E3%81%AE%E5%90%91%E3%81%93%E3%81%86_Beyond_the_Gate_%288359544249%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%A4%A7%E6%89%8B%E9%96%80%E3%81%AE%E5%90%91%E3%81%93%E3%81%86_Beyond_the_Gate_(8359544249).jpg",
      "width": 4132,
      "height": 2755,
      "mime": "image/jpeg",
      "license": "CC BY 2.0",
      "licenseUrl": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0",
      "artist": "Yuya Sekiguchi",
      "description": "大手門の向こう\n2012年12月28日、上田城跡の大手門を通して見える眞田神社とその鳥居。\nこの日の雪は12月にしてはかなり多いものになりました。雪が比較的早く溶ける上田でさえ、まだ路上に雪が残っています。\n\nBeyond the Gate\n12/28/2012, Sanada Shrine and its shrine gate seen through from the front gate of Uedajyo-Castle remains.\n\nThe snow storm on that day was pretty big for Ueda, leaving a beautiful scenery for half a day and soggy unwalkable streets for a couple of days later.",
      "dateCreated": "2012-12-28 07:17",
      "categories": [
